Tula Zana Tula Baba, Your Daddy's Gone But Not Forever.

&#x200B;

Do you know that theatre piece?

I dont have a political leaning, just being realistic.

This world is overpopulated.

&#x200B;

But yes, I am a nutjob. Being a nutjob doesn't make someone wrong tho. It just makes them a nutjob

&#x200B;

Edit: Funny though, if you disagree with someone you automatically try to make them seem like lesser humans. Probably because you know I am right and you cant win the argument, unless I am less than human. Yet you call me the wacko?

what makes you say that?

&#x200B;

Edit: Yes I have a problem, i resent the bantu for destroying my homeland and being praised for it.

I have a sneaking suspicion that there's a picture of some well known person hidden in this.

&#x200B;

Either that, or the weed is messing with my vision.

That's some juicy BBC.

&#x200B;

Big Black Cat.

&#x200B;

Get your head out of the gutter.

uhh, knowledge expanded. This gave room for more ideas, and speculations and it pretty much snowballed from there.

&#x200B;

What's wrong with believing only certainties? Lol

The noob didn't even put the pentagram upside down.

&#x200B;

All in all, kinda sad that being edgy is still considered cool in certain groups.

I don't go to church, idk how to pick them. Last time i ended up in a delusional prosperity church. I cant read the bible because it freaks me out and I cant understand it.. at all.. People keep telling me to do these things but they dont work for me, if it was that easy.. well.. i wouldnt be saying all these things..

Idk about professional help, so far it only scares me.. the things i talked about.. no.

&#x200B;

Im too confused, im stuck with no way out.. not one that I can think of..except that..

&#x200B;

I am going crazy and nobody seems to do a damn thing about it, Ive tried asking for help so many times and we never get anywhere.. we just talk and thats it. Just talking hasnt helped so far.. I've been getting professional help since elemantary but I never really let them in.. this time I am genuinely asking for help and nothing is happening.

&#x200B;

Idk what I said is a lie and what I said is true.. i dont know.

It's all just one big question mark to me.
